  {
    "index": 42,
    "pointer_offset": "0x0054",
    "file_offset": "0x0840",
    "jp": "ちょっとぉ、他に何かないわけ？{n}まあ、仕方ないわね、もらってあげるわ。",
    "tr": "Seriously, that's all you have? Oh, fine. I'll take it.",
    "reviewed": false,
