  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "pointer_offset": "0x009c",
    "file_offset": "0x0bb8",
    "jp": "あたし・・・、いつかきっと、{n}あなたのモノになったげる。",
    "tr": "I... One day, I know I'll be yours.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "pointer_offset": "0x009e",
    "file_offset": "0x0bf2",
    "jp": "へえ、ボクの欲しい物よくわかるね。{n}おじさん、いいとこあるじゃん。",
    "tr": "Wow, you really know what I like. You're not so bad, mister.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00a0",
    "file_offset": "0x0c36",
    "jp": "ねぇ、おじちゃんって、{n}なんでこんなに優しいの。アリガトウ。",
    "tr": "Why are you always so nice, mister? Thank you.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00a2",
    "file_offset": "0x0c74",
    "jp": "あら素敵！プレゼントって、{n}幾つになっても、嬉しいものなのよね。",
    "tr": "How lovely! No matter your age, a present is always a joy.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00a4",
    "file_offset": "0x0cb6",
    "jp": "ふざけんじゃねえぞ、コラ！{n}スゲエ、嬉しいじゃねえか。",
    "tr": "Don't screw with me, punk! Damn, this makes me happy!",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00a6",
    "file_offset": "0x0cee",
    "jp": "先の短い年寄りには、もったいないのう。{n}いつも感謝してるぞい。",
    "tr": "This is too good for an old man with little time left. I am always grateful.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00a8",
    "file_offset": "0x0d2e",
    "jp": "物欲を利用しようというのですか・・・。{n}・・・なるほどね。",
    "tr": "Trying to buy my favor with material goods...? I see.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
