  {
    "index": 108,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00d8",
    "file_offset": "0x0dfa",
    "jp": "長イ、ツキアイニ、ナリソウダナ。",
    "tr": "IT SEEMS WE WILL BE TOGETHER A LONG TIME.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00da",
    "file_offset": "0x0e1c",
    "jp": "キサマ、ヨクシテクレル。{n}ダカラ、オレサマ、カワル。",
    "tr": "YOU TREAT ME GOOD. SO I CHANGE.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00dc",
    "file_offset": "0x0e52",
    "jp": "年々歳々花相似、歳々年々人不同・・・。{n}然し、我は永遠の忠誠を誓うなり。",
    "tr": "Year after year, the flowers remain, while men grow old... Yet my loyalty shall be eternal.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00de",
    "file_offset": "0x0e9c",
    "jp": "貴殿と出会えたことを、感謝する。{n}感謝だけでは足りんかもな・・・。",
    "tr": "I am grateful that our paths crossed. Though perhaps gratitude alone is not enough...",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00e0",
    "file_offset": "0x0ee0",
    "jp": "今までつくしてくれたお礼をしたいわ。",
    "tr": "I want to repay you for all you have done for me.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00e2",
    "file_offset": "0x0f06",
    "jp": "俺も恩義を知らないわけじゃねぇからな。{n}いいぜ、業魔殿に連れていけよ。",
    "tr": "I'm not one to forget a debt. All right, take me to the Gouma-den.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00e4",
    "file_offset": "0x0f4e",
    "jp": "ここまでされちゃ、アタシだって・・・、{n}私を業魔殿へ連れてって！",
    "tr": "After all you've done, even I... Take me to the Gouma-den!",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00e6",
    "file_offset": "0x0f90",
    "jp": "今度から、おじさんのこと、{n}お兄さんって呼ぶよ。いいだろ・・・。",
    "tr": "From now on, I'll call you big brother instead of mister. That's okay, right...?",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00e8",
    "file_offset": "0x0fd2",
    "jp": "おじちゃん、あたしがいないと困る？{n}いつも、いっしょにいてあげるね。",
    "tr": "Would you miss me if I were gone, mister? I'll stay with you forever.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00ea",
    "file_offset": "0x1018",
    "jp": "あなたの気持ちだけで十分なのに・・・。{n}アタシ、いつもあなたの側にいたい・・・。",
    "tr": "Your feelings alone are enough... I want to stay by your side forever...",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00ec",
    "file_offset": "0x106a",
    "jp": "オレとおまえは、ウッキーだ。{n}これからも、よきウッキーでいよう。",
    "tr": "You and me are monkey buddies. Let's stay good monkey buddies forever.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00ee",
    "file_offset": "0x10ac",
    "jp": "わしのような老いぼれでよければ、{n}今後もお世話になろうかの、ほっほっほ。",
    "tr": "If an old codger like me will do, I shall remain in your care. Ho ho ho!",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00f0",
    "file_offset": "0x10f6",
    "jp": "よくここまで俺の関心をひいたな。{n}ま、お約束だ。いいぜ、好きにしろよ。",
    "tr": "You've done well to hold my interest this long. A promise is a promise. Do as you please.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00f2",
    "file_offset": "0x113e",
    "jp": "いろいろ世話になったから、{n}このぐらいでなんか、お返しせんとなぁ。",
    "tr": "You've done a lot for me. It's time I returned the favor.",
    "reviewed": false,
    "excluded": false
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "pointer_offset": "0x00f4",
    "file_offset": "0x1182",
    "jp": "ズズーッピチャッ！！！{n}ズズズーーッ！！！",
    "tr": "SLUUURP-SPLASH!!! SLURRRRP!!!",
